p=A.a([A.c(a3,0,'Page 145 Activity 1: "I always make my bed after I wake up."',"v_27_1_1",A.a(["make my bed","do my fire","make my laundry","do a cake"],e8),'1. Unit 27A Activity 1: "I always _______ after I wake up."'),A.c(d1,1,"TG Activity 3A Morning Answers: do the cleaning, do the laundry.","v_27_1_2",A.a(["make a small cake and make a cup of tea",d1,"make a fire and make a plan","make pineapple juice and do the shopping"],e8),"2. Unit 27A Activity 3A Morning: Besides making two sandwiches, what must Channy do for Leakhana?"),A.c("Somnang",2,'TG Audioscript: Somnang says, "Also, make a cup of tea too. I want to give it to Richard."',"v_27_1_3",A.a(["Leakhana","Pisey","Somnang","Kosal"],e8),"3. Unit 27A Activity 3B: Who wants Channy to make a cup of tea for Richard in the afternoon?"),A.c("Pisey",3,"TG Activity 3B Answers: Pisey -> make a plan (for their trip to Kampot).","v_27_1_4",A.a(["Leakhana","Somnang","Richard","Pisey"],e8),"4. Unit 27A Activity 3B: Who called an hour ago asking Channy to make a plan for their trip to Kampot?"),A.c(d2,0,'TG Audioscript: Kosal says mum told him to make a fire to grill meat, "but the football match is starting on TV!"',"v_27_1_5",A.a([d2,"Because he is doing his maths homework","Because he is going to Kampot","Because he is making a cake"],e8),"5. Unit 27A Activity 3B: Why did Kosal ask Channy to make a fire in the evening?"),A.c(d3,1,'TG Audioscript: Kosal says, "In the morning, I have to do the washing and ironing for everyone!"',"v_27_1_6",A.a(["do the cooking and dishes",d3,"make a cake and a dress","make a phone call and a note"],e8),"6. Unit 27B Activity 2A: What does Kosal have to do in the morning for everyone?"),A.c("making the bed",2,'TG Audioscript: "After making the bed, I also need to do the laundry..."',"v_27_1_7",A.a(["doing the gardening","making a phone call","making the bed","doing the shopping"],e8),"7. Unit 27B Activity 2A: What is the FIRST thing Sokha does before doing the laundry?"),A.c("does the dishes",3,'TG Activity 4: "At 8 in the morning, Tim does the dishes alone."',"v_27_1_8",A.a(["makes some orange juice","does the shopping","does the ironing","does the dishes"],e8),"8. Unit 27B Activity 4: What chore does Tim do alone at 8:00 in the morning?"),A.c(d4,0,"TG Activity 4: Richard makes orange juice at 9:25am; Vicki does the shopping at 10:10am.","v_27_1_9",A.a([d4,"Tim and Lynn","Sokha and Kosal","Channy and Pisey"],e8),"9. Unit 27B Activity 4: Who makes some orange juice at 9:25 am, and who does the shopping at 10:10 am?"),A.c(d5,1,"TG Activity 4: Tim and Lynn make a cake at 1pm; Lynn does the ironing at 2:30pm.","v_27_1_10",A.a(["make bread; does the shopping",d5,"do the dishes; makes a phone call","do the cooking; does the gardening"],e8),"10. Unit 27B Activity 4: What do Tim and Lynn make at 1:00 pm, and what does Lynn do at 2:30 pm?")],f5)
